@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / -> 200 OK (Kiem tra may chu dang chay)
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET /api/assignments -> 200 OK (Danh sach bai tap)
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST hop le -> 201 Created + Location, status = "received"
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. GET doc lai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu (thieu ma SV/kho ma nguon) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bai tap khong ton tai (ID 999) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. GET id khong hop le / rong -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions

### 8. Bat tay SignalR dung tuyen -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub (/hub thieu 's') -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
